From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wu Yuwei <yuweiwu@pm.me>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 07:43:46 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Take the first font when it covers a cluster

`FontSelector::select_font` remembers the first font its query yields with
a charmap (`first_font`, where it remembered only whether there was one),
and forgets it where it did before: a new segment, other families, other
attributes.

When that font covers the cluster completely it is taken without the query,
whose answer would be the same. Most clusters are in the first font, and the
query went through the families and their fonts for each one. A debug build
runs the query again each time and checks that it gives that font.

No result changes.
